<title>SWEDEN: S&amp;P affirms Handelsbanken rating/ups Stadshypotek.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms Handelsbanken rating/ups Stadshypotek.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit rating agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it had affirmed Handelsbanken's ratings and raised Stadshypotek's ratings with the outlook for both negative.</p>
<p>The agency said it had removed Handelsbanken's ratings from credit watch after the bank this week finalised its 22.9 billion crown takeover bid for mortgage bank Stadshypotek.</p>
</text>
